.TH NSH 1 "November 2026" "ix"
.SH NAME
nsh, nhs \- the New Human Shell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nsh
.RI [ -c " command"]
.SH DESCRIPTION
In a terminal nsh evaluates each line in Bash. A failed line is sent to
.BR yhwh (1)
with the status and diagnostics. While a question is pending, the next line
is an answer. Cancel with Ctrl+C or :cancel.
.PP
Prefix a command with
.B ld.so
to use its ordinary status without asking. Use
.B :paste
and finish with a blank line to enter a block. With redirected input or
with
.BR -c ,
nsh behaves as Bash.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yhwh (1),
.BR LD (1)
